# Build output.
#
# The solution redirects bin/ and obj/ into artifacts/ (see Directory.Build.props), so the
# per-project directories below are belt and braces for anything that bypasses that.

[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# The installer build tree. Regenerated on every build, never committed, and it contains the
# compiled MSI -- a binary artefact that has no business in version control, and one that would
# make a diff unreviewable.
installer/build/
installer/obj/
*.wixobj/
*.wixpdb

# NuGet
packages.lock.json is intentionally NOT ignored: this solution restores pinned versions so a
# build in six months produces the same binaries. An unlocked restore is how a Windows App SDK
# update lands silently and changes the output.